      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cb9bea4107a96e0",
      "translationZh": "Octop 是一款开源、自托管的 AI 助手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb269c0a64af591a",
      "translationZh": "通过多智能体架构，它为团队、家庭和个人构建了一个既独立又协作的智能环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d43af024bcfc3097",
      "translationZh": "最棒的是，它完全在你的机器上运行；完全自托管的设计意味着隐私永远不必妥协，而单进程启动则让功能强大的 Web 控制台、CLI 和 IM 集成触手可及。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd54289c4af74336",
      "translationZh": "Web 仪表板 — 聊天、专家 / 团队、连接器、频道、cron、知识、插件、设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c5d7f6a0cdfba55",
      "translationZh": "桌面客户端 — 适用于 Windows / macOS / Linux 的原生应用；适用于 NAS 的 FnOS 软件包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "215a4cbfeb09d972",
      "translationZh": "CLI — octop run、octop chats、octop acp、管理命令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75dd4aab4f9cc736",
      "translationZh": "HTTP/SSE/WebSocket API — 完整的编程访问能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "473443641ef40929",
